# pc-locks (BENCH-253) round 16: c is master, aa its A/A copy; each lever arm is master with its line on the panel robots
# that locked with it (plans/locks-pick.tsv; rbd RAM-18 escape bend, rp POW-17 race power, vj VEL-JIT velocity jitter, pm MOVE-56 pattern-matcher mimic).
# bb is master as it was before MOVE-56 and SHIELD-33 (4d6a3ca76): those two lines are already on master (PRs #970, #971),
# so their robots are read as c minus bb.
c | hadur117.Hadur 3.23 | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23.jar
aa | hadur117.Hadur 3.23aa | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23aa.jar
bb | hadur117.Hadur 3.23bb | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23bb.jar
rbd | hadur117.Hadur 3.23rbd | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23rbd.jar
rp | hadur117.Hadur 3.23rp | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23rp.jar
vj | hadur117.Hadur 3.23vj | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23vj.jar
pm | hadur117.Hadur 3.23pm | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.23pm.jar
